{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dreamdawn</i> is a top-down action-adventure of introspection where reality and dream intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step draws you deeper into the mind of the protagonist, facing fears that take physical form in a surreal world of light and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore atmospheric landscapes, solve environmental puzzles, and discover something new in every corner of a surreal world that reflects your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/62a859c2b4130b19308f0b732fc54da2.poster.avif?t=1761793024\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/62a859c2b4130b19308f0b732fc54da2.webm?t=1761793024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/62a859c2b4130b19308f0b732fc54da2.mp4?t=1761793024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration \u2013 Dreamlike landscapes and hidden secrets</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse atmospheric environments rich with symbolism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover alternate routes and hidden passages that reward curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non\u2011linear world that unfolds according to your choices and acquired abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/3634b5467eee527bffccbf3568f74f79.poster.avif?t=1761793024\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/3634b5467eee527bffccbf3568f74f79.webm?t=1761793024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/3634b5467eee527bffccbf3568f74f79.mp4?t=1761793024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression \u2013 Ability-Gated\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities that transform the way you explore and fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to previous areas to uncover secrets once out of reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is tied to both mechanics and narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/4cd837e2c5d92291517d2cb211d1e7df.poster.avif?t=1761793024\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/4cd837e2c5d92291517d2cb211d1e7df.webm?t=1761793024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/4cd837e2c5d92291517d2cb211d1e7df.mp4?t=1761793024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat \u2013 Precise and deliberate</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face strange guardians and shadow\u2011born creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action RPG\u2011style battles with an emphasis on strategy and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy carries a backstory and a role within the world\u2019s symbolic narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075660/extras/4fd9963447376ac155ab8db4f4702dbe.poster.avif?t=1761793024\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.a